    "text": "Given,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Thus,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mr